    {
      "turn": 4,
      "doctor_question": "When you are not feeling that bright, fast, and energetic way, do you still hear those voices or feel like people are sending you messages?",
      "targeted_symptom": "additional_requirement_3",
      "patient_response": "Well, let me think on that... yes, yes I do. There was a quiet month not too long ago, maybe late autumn. I was sleeping just perfectly normal, going to bed at nine and waking up with the sun, and I wasn't full of all those big plans or feeling fast at all. I usually sleep on my left side, you know, 'cause of my digestion. If I eat green peppers or onions after four o'clock, I get the worst heartburn. My wife makes a wonderful sausage and pepper bake, but I always tell her, you gotta serve it by noon or I'll be pacing the floor all night. \n\nBut anyway, even during that quiet month when my mood was just flat and regular, I still heard my friend out there on the porch. Clear as day. And I still knew that radio announcer was sending me those warnings. \n\nSpeaking of the porch, the paint is peeling awful bad on the west side. We painted it a nice robin's egg blue a few years back, but the sun just beats down on it all afternoon. Fades the color right out. You really gotta use a good oil-based primer if you want it to last, but these days they just water everything down. You buy a gallon of paint now and it's half water, I swear. I was telling the fellow at the hardware store...",
